  "content": "[Intro]\n[G]\n[D7]  [D#dim7]\n[Em]  [C]\n[D7sus2]  [D7]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[G]I bless the\n[D/F#]day I [D]found [D#dim7]you\n[Em]I want to\n[Bm/D]stay around you\n[C]And so I\n[G/B]beg you,\n[Am]let it [D7]be\n[G6]me\n[G]Don't take this\n[D/F#]heaven [D]from [D#dim7]one\n[Em]If you must\n[Bm/D]cling to someone\n[C]Now and for-\n[G/B]ever,\n[Am]let it [D7]be\n[G6]me\n\n[Chorus]\n[C]Each time we\n[Bm]meet love\n[C]I find comp-\n[Gmaj7]lete love\n[Am7]Without your\n[G/B]sweet love\n[C]what would life\n[B]be\n\n[Verse 2]\n[G]So never\n[D/F#]leave me [D#dim7][D]lonely\n[Em]Tell me you\n[Bm/D]love me only\n[C]And that you'll\n[G/B]always\n[Am]let it [D7]be\n[G6]me\n\n[Chorus]\n[C]Each time we\n[Bm]meet love\n[C]I find comp-\n[Gmaj7]lete love\n[Am7]Without your\n[G/B]sweet love\n[C]what would life\n[B]be\n\n[Verse 3]\n[G]So never\n[D/F#]leave me [D#dim7][D]lonely\n[Em]Tell me you\n[Bm/D]love me only\n[C]And that you'll\n[G/B]always\n[Am]\n[D7]let it be\n\n[Outro]\n[G6]me",
